<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#paper-type-manumission-instrument> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A legal instrument by which an enslaved person was formally freed by their enslaver. Coartación documents, cartas de libertad, and similar instruments. Manumission could be conditional, partial, or purchased (coartación) — the instrument type records the terms."@en .
