<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#period-1808-1820> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Nominal suppression period: the Atlantic trade was illegal under U.S. and British law but continued with reduced official documentation, irregular certifications, and increased reliance on existing ownership chains to obscure recent imports."@en .
