<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#method-cross-tradition-synthesis> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Reconstruction by synthesizing elements from multiple related surviving traditions to fill gaps in a fragmented one."@en .
