<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#tradePeriod> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Atlantic slave trade chronological period in which this slave paper was produced or to which it belongs. Range: iroko:SlavePaperPeriodScheme. The three TiSP periods reflect distinct legal regimes: pre-1808 (open Atlantic trade), 1808-1820 (nominal suppression, ongoing trade), post-1820 (intensified illegal trade requiring more elaborate documentary apparatus)."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ReconstructionMethodScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#method-cross-tradition-synthesis> .
