<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#paper-type-sale-record> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A notarized instrument documenting the sale or transfer of an enslaved person between owners. Core document in the Atlantic ownership chain; required notarial authentication in most colonial legal systems."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#afroAtlanticTradition> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#minimumAccessLevel> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#access-public-unrestricted> .
