<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#paper-function-ownership-claim> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Document asserts or transfers a legal ownership claim over an enslaved person."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#recognition-pending> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pending"@en .
